<FeatureFacts id="sync" />

With Pro, sign in on each device and LogIt keeps them the same: workouts, splits, exercises, habits,
goals, food lists and settings. Changes made offline sync when you're back online. If the same split
was changed on two devices, you're asked which one to keep.

## Free backup

<FeatureFacts id="free-backup" />

A free account backs up the phone you use it on: workouts, splits, exercises, habits, goals, food
lists and settings. Get a new phone, sign in, and everything comes back. The backup belongs to one
phone at a time. Signing in on another phone moves it there, and the first phone stops backing up
until you sign in on it again. To keep two phones the same, or to use the web dashboard, get Pro.

